      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 2 months ago",
      "body": "Sonia24 well done on BFing for 12 months that is amazing. I BFed my ED for 18 months and I never dried up, I got to the point were I was able to go without pads after about 4 months but I then pregnant after 5 months of stopping with my YS. Again I never dried up with him but I think that was because I fell pregnant while he was still BFing.",
