      "author_handle": "kristag",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 2 months ago",
      "body": "I breastfed for 6 months and dropped as Soup said to one feed a day (I did this gradually) and then when I stopped completely, it took around 7 days to me to be able to not wear breast pads.  Having said that, I fed Sophie a couple of weeks ago (she's 9 1/2 months now) and suddenly I was soaking wet down one side!",
